  "remarks": "Aleksei Manikin is the beneficial owner and co-owner of “Beget” LLC and is one of those who decide company business strategy. Since 2014, “Beget” LLC has knowingly provided services to Russian backed illegal authorities, militarised organisations and propagandist projects in illegally annexed Crimea, Donetsk and Luhansk, as well as to a significant number of Russian defence companies relevant for Russia’s efforts in continuing the war of aggression against Ukraine.",
